{"ID":"20240118151009-2sys8sn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151009-2sys8sn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151009-2sys8sn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151009-trq7n7t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153636-hwusmhu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:431,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153636-hwusmhu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:186,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:186\u0026#125;","title":"294商陆","type":"doc","updated":"20240204104643"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151009-trq7n7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151009-trq7n7t","updated":"20240122153548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，有毒。治水胀，疝瘕，痹，熨除痈肿，杀鬼精物。生川谷。一名根。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153551-0slm42o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153551-0slm42o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多生山野阴地，其根有赤白两种，赤者有毒，白者入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153552-8qvgvxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153552-8qvgvxn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦（或作辛），性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153554-w2jg6dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153554-w2jg6dj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】商陆为利水消肿要药，主治水肿，瘕疝，脚气胀满，能疏五臓，散水气，通利大小肠，并可傅痈疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153556-9ajxsi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153556-9ajxsi5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗胸邪气，水肿痿痹，腹满洪，直疏五臓，散水气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153558-tzgwakj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153558-tzgwakj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】泻十种水病，喉痹不通，薄切醋炒涂喉外良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153559-y7altlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153559-y7altlr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】通大小肠，泻蛊毒，堕胎，熁肿毒，傅恶物。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153600-wk2dqgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153600-wk2dqgk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】商陆用根，取其内透膜膈，以导水下行。一般用苗则升，用根则降。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153602-i4be7yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153602-i4be7yv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱左右 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153604-sdbtfca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153604-sdbtfca"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】虚人禁用，赤者有毒伤人，只堪贴脐，商陆入麝香少许，用以利溲水肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153604-ang3223","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153604-ang3223"}},{"ID":"20240122153604-slzo6il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153604-slzo6il"}},{"ID":"20240122153605-ka2nx7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153605-ka2nx7g","updated":"20240204104138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"294，商陆，对，我们就用到了，哦，诸位看看商陆长的这个样子，很奇怪的样子，这就是商陆。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有一种方式，排水，又不伤正，不管他元气强还是元气弱，就是过去那个商陆，把它打粉以后，放一点点麝香，因为麝香就来至麝的肚脐嘛，无孔不入，混点麝香在里面，然后用棉布包起来，放在病人肚脐上，然后，你如果加温，你可用那个熨斗或什么，现在有个电热毯在上面加热，一放上边，就开始排小便，不用内服，外敷，就开始排小便，因为商陆涤水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们可以看到。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153616-v7qite3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153616-v7qite3","updated":"20240204104218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本经的原文：商陆的味道是辛辣的，平，有毒，专门治水胀。那商陆有两种，一种是赤根的，一种是白的，你们现在看到是白色的，白色的入药，赤色的可以外用，赤色的很毒，不要吃，赤色我们拿来敷肚脐，比白色的好，因为它很强嘛。那这个你看哦，这个性味：味苦性寒有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153621-9nywgml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153621-9nywgml","updated":"20240122153621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治呢，商陆是利水消肿的要药，主治水肿，可不可以内服？当然可以内服。你看商陆的样子，轻轻的，一般来说你用1钱，大、重剂2钱就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153626-7jg4o35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153626-7jg4o35","updated":"20240204104452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个商陆呢，最主要是下焦，脚肿胀满，诸位看这个【甄权】：泄10种水病，喉痹不通，那个通大小肠，那个【大明】有没有？唐容川呢，说这商陆用根，因为它内透膈膜，导水下行，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般我们用商陆的根。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153631-7mk83xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153631-7mk83xc","updated":"20240122153635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这种处方呢，一吃下去，大概2分钟半个小时最多，就开始有反应了，就开始跑厕所，就这么快。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153636-hwusmhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153636-hwusmhu","updated":"20240204104643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那禁忌里面最后一段，你看哦，赤色的，赤商陆颜色是红色的根的话只能贴肚脐用的。这是一个很强的药，张仲景呢，还没有使用到商陆，张仲景只使用到甘遂、芫花，大戟最多，商陆啊，牵牛他很少用。那临证上面到我们以后会介绍张仲景的排水的药以后，我们会加些商陆，我们看看什么时机，我们提醒诸位怎么用。一般来说1钱，大、严重的用2钱，诸位一定要记得，要用白色的商陆根，赤色的不可以用，外敷可以用赤色的，敷在肚脐上面。"}]}]}